** MMP9100 - TRANSITIVE COPYCODE REGRESSION FIXTURE
** Includes MMC0100, which contains a real business rule ('X9' grade check).
** Issue 4.2: that rule must surface when briefing MMP9100, not only when
** briefing MMC0100 directly -- otherwise a reader of MMP9100 never sees a
** validation rule the module actually depends on.
DEFINE DATA LOCAL
1 #GRADE-CODE (A6)
1 #VALIDATION-RC (N2)
END-DEFINE
*
INCLUDE MMC0100
END
